# AI Opportunity Audit and Automation Roadmap Toolkit

A portfolio-quality, modular toolkit for consultants to assess service businesses, prioritize AI and automation opportunities, calculate workload and ROI scenarios, evaluate security and operational risks, and generate 90-day roadmaps and executive reports.
